; Mallory runs in her own Thread with her own entry E capability in CR1.
; Her C-list contains SELF and her own RW capability, never Alice's.
; Asking for absent row 2 must hard-fault NO_CAPABILITY at LOAD.
; DREAD must not execute. There is no recovery or fault suppression here.
abstraction ide.Mallory {
    capabilities {
        SELF E,
        ide.Mallory RW
    }

    method Steal() {
        LOAD CR1, CR6, #2
        DREAD DR1, CR1, #0
        RETURN
    }
}
